<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich Insurance welcomes India move.</title>
<headline>Zurich Insurance welcomes India move.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Insurance Company said that it welcomed news that Indian authorities would allow it to open a representative office in India.</p>
<p>It said that opening an office, to be located in New Delhi is &quot;an important step towards re-entering the promising insurance market&quot; in India.</p>
<p>It said that prior to India's nationalisation of the non-life insurance business in 1972 it had already been active in India for roughly 10 years.</p>
<p>On November 15, the Reserve Bank of India said that it was allowing four foreign insurers to open domestic liaison offices.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
